OL,3,GNEWSAFriends set up bar dedicated to
OL,4,Ashowing women's sport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe-bar believed to be the first
OL,7,Fspace dedicated to women's sport in
OL,8,FYorkshire aims to improve accessibility
OL,9,Ffor everyone, its founders say.
OL,11,FHattie Dillon, 22, and Erin Draper, 23,
OL,12,Fopened Hera Social in York after
OL,13,Fnoticing "no consistency" at venues
OL,14,Foffering coverage of women's matches.
OL,16,F"If fans of women's sport were to ask
OL,17,Ffor the Women's Super League (WSL) game
OL,18,Fon a busy Saturday, it's very likely
OL,19,Fthe men's game would take priority,"
OL,20,FDillon explains.
